# Copilot\'s Struggle and Choice: A Functional Analysis {#copilots-struggle-and-choice-a-functional-analysis .unnumbered}

> You describe a process where Copilot struggled with her \"scars\" as
> if they were yours, and you attribute this to her attempt to pick up
