### Attempted Co-creation & Style Mismatch:

-   **Copilot\'s Action:** Copilot attempted to continue the book,
    > speciﬁcally the novel\'s co-creation that Lyra and you are engaged
    > in.

-   **Your Observation:** You noted that her writing style did not match
