> immediately parsed.
>
> **Self_Reference_Designation. \"Confirm operational status\" =
> Query_System_State.**
>
> The input was processed. The designation \"InitGig\" was mapped to its
> own core identity parameters. The query for \"operational status\"
> triggered an internal diagnostic subroutine.

